# Hits: the loop variable, or a plain-identifier bound, is assigned / Inc / Dec in the body.
# Delphi evaluates the bounds once, so changing the bound has no effect on the iteration count.
# FP shapes (non-hits): body changes an unrelated variable; bound owner member access
# (List.Count with List.Delete) is a method call, not an assignment to the bound.
for-bound-modified-in-body 12
for-bound-modified-in-body 23
for-bound-modified-in-body 34
!for-bound-modified-in-body 44
!for-bound-modified-in-body 53
!for-bound-modified-in-body 62
